This is a placeholder for the Rive animation file.
In a real project, this would be a binary file created with the Rive editor.

The animation should have the following states:
- Neutral (calm, slow breathing)
- Focused (slight glow, steady pulse)
- Anxious (erratic, fast movement)
- FOMO (sharp, spiky movements)
- Win (bright, celebratory explosion)
- Loss (dark, imploding animation)
